# "You may begin the game with it on the battlefield" (CR 103.6a): Bot1 declines, so the Leyline stays in hand and a Snakeskin Veil on Bot1's
# Llanowar Elves is not copied (one +1/+1 counter, not two). Positive control: leyline-of-resonance-copies-a-spell-that-targets-only-your-creature.

